==Russian==
[[Category:Russian nouns]]

===Etymology===
Old Church Slavonic [[вѣра]] identical to {{proto|Slavic|věra|lang=ru}}, from from {{proto|Indo-European|weh₁ro-|lang=ru|true}}.  Cognate with Ukrainian [[віра]], Bulgarian [[вяра]], Slovenian ''[[vera]]'', Polish ''[[wiara]]''.  The IE root is also the source of Latin {{term|verus|vērus|lang=ru}} and German {{term|wahr|lang=de}}.

===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|Ru-вера.ogg|audio}}

